   "title": "Validated IP is never pinned: DNS re-resolves at connect time (rebinding TOCTOU)",
   "evidence": "_validate_url calls socket.getaddrinfo and rejects non-global addresses, then hands the raw URL string to requests, which resolves the name a second time; the address that was checked is not the address that is connected to.",
