   "title": "Proxy env vars let the proxy resolve the host, bypassing the local IP check",
   "evidence": "requests.get is called with default trust_env, so with HTTPS_PROXY set the request goes to the proxy which performs its own DNS resolution; the local is_global check then proves nothing about the connection target.",
